	<section_number>38.2-4017</section_number>
	<catch_line>Notice of assessment</catch_line>
	<text>
		Each notice of assessment made by any burial society upon any of its members shall state the cause and purpose of the assessment.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, §§ 38-145, 38-453; 1952, c. 317, §§ 38.1-547, 38.1-555; 1986, c. 562.</history>
